abstract: "Computational companion to From target rheology to formulation: benchmarking data-driven models for shear modulus prediction and computational candidate design for multi-component biopolymer hydrogels. Includes retained formulation data, new-series nested validation, fitted GP, Monte Carlo preparation scenarios, exploratory MCMC and untested candidate recipes. Historical benchmark training pipelines and raw rheology fitting inputs are not included."
keywords:
  - hydrogel
  - rheology
  - Gaussian process
  - grouped validation
  - Monte Carlo
